                                                "text": "He is such an ass for leaving the house door open."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1582160a-9913-4274-9d77-8bee8f45d274",
                                                "sense_id": "d5f3070d-928a-36b0-a7f8-5d0f522dd6af",
                                                "text": "Oh Vengeance! / Who? What an Aſſe am I?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87f409fb-fbd9-4a47-a499-f40160d65c1c",
                                                "sense_id": "d5f3070d-928a-36b0-a7f8-5d0f522dd6af",
                                                "text": "I had sprung to my feet. I was speaking, and yet I had prepared no words. Tarp Henry, my companion, was plucking at my skirts and I heard him whispering, \"Sit down, Malone! Don't make a public ass of yourself.\""
                                            }
