                                                "sense_id": "4530c8e3-b315-3f0f-b8ee-b853d945d584",
                                                "text": "Or to put it in the more colourful language of our Prime Minister: \"The secret to improving rail transport, in my view, is you need to find the right arse to kick.\" Unfortunately, since the abolition of the Strategic Rail Authority (SRA) in 2005, the DfT has ostensibly been in direct control of railway policy setting, and this has meant that the only arse the government has been able to kick is its own."
                                            }
